{
  "title": "Coordination Cluster Nuclearity Decreases with Decreasing Rare Earth Ionic Radius in 1:1 Cr/Ln N-Butyldiethanolamine Compounds: A Journey across the Lanthanide Series from Cr4IIILa4–Cr4IIITb4 via Cr3IIIDy3 and Cr3IIIHo3 to Cr2IIIEr2–Cr2IIILu2",
